#: awx/sso/conf.py:807 awx/sso/conf.py:1071
msgid ""
"Create an organization-owned application at "
"https://github.com/organizations/<yourorg>/settings/applications and obtain "
"an OAuth2 key (Client ID) and secret (Client Secret). Provide this URL as "
"the callback URL for your application."
msgstr ""
"أنشئ تطبيقًا مملوكًا للمؤسسة على "
"https://github.com/organizations/<yourorg>/settings/applications واحصل على "
"مفتاح OAuth2 (معرّف العميل) وسر (سر العميل). قدّم عنوان URL هذا كعنوان URL "
"لاستدعاء تطبيقك."

